  (text "Pi header: 3.3 V (pins 1/17) feeds the ID EEPROM and the I2C pull-ups; 5 V (2/4) the LDO U4.  GPIO9 (pin 21) = NRST, GPIO10 (pin 19) = MCU power" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0820ee94-93a8-5196-afc9-7d194460d314"))
  (text "enable, GPIO18 (pin 12) = trigger, GPIO24/25 = SWD, GPIO14/15 = UART; GPIO 4/5/6/17/22/23/27 (the bonnet's buttons) stay free.  No SPI0 / I2S / PWM-on-18 overlays." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "660b9e71-3f3b-5ddf-b78e-b109fe2ff1df"))
